WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:16.845
Kip was sad.

2
00:00:16.846 --> 00:00:22.364
He wanted to be a police officer.

3
00:00:22.365 --> 00:00:32.308
But nobody listened to him.

4
00:00:32.309 --> 00:00:35.448
"Don't worry, Kip," said Bird.

5
00:00:35.449 --> 00:00:39.012
"You can pretend you're a police officer."

6
00:00:39.013 --> 00:00:45.189
Kip sighed. "I don't want to pretend.

7
00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:49.764
I'm going home."

8
00:00:49.765 --> 00:01:00.663
Kip started to walk away.

9
00:01:00.664 --> 00:01:03.580
Suddenly he saw a girl on a bike.

10
00:01:03.581 --> 00:01:14.283
The girl was riding fast on the path.

11
00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:16.944
Kip also saw Squirrel.

12
00:01:16.945 --> 00:01:21.933
Squirrel was walking toward the path.

13
00:01:21.934 --> 00:01:28.247
He was carrying a tall pile of acorns.

14
00:01:28.248 --> 00:01:32.655
"Oh no!" said Kip.

15
00:01:32.656 --> 00:01:37.750
"Squirrel can't see that girl!"

16
00:01:37.751 --> 00:01:39.877
Kip ran fast.

17
00:01:39.878 --> 00:01:42.276
He jumped in front of Squirrel.

18
00:01:42.277 --> 00:01:44.486
Kip blew his whistle.

19
00:01:44.487 --> 00:01:46.876
Squirrel stopped.

20
00:01:46.877 --> 00:01:49.274
"Wait," said Kip.

21
00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:53.725
The girl on the bike zoomed by.

22
00:01:53.726 --> 00:01:56.831
"Now you can go," said Kip.

23
00:01:56.832 --> 00:01:59.456
"Thanks, Kip!" said Squirrel.

24
00:01:59.457 --> 00:02:05.832
"No problem," said Kip.

25
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:10.401
Bird smiled.

26
00:02:10.402 --> 00:02:21.238
"Good job, Officer Kip!"
